{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16887","headline":"晨兴寄赠窦使君 · 武元衡","name":"晨兴寄赠窦使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江陵岁方晏，晨起眄庭柯。\n白露伤红叶，清风断绿萝。\n徇时真气索，念远怀忧多。\n夙昔乐山意，纵横南浦波。\n有美婵娟子，百虑攒双蛾。\n缄情郁不舒，幽行骈复罗。\n爲予歌苦寒，酌酒朱颜酡。\n世事浮云变，功名将奈何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16887.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16887","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}